First of all, congratulations on making it to the Endgame!


1.  When you have the amulet something happens every 50 turns.
Sometimes this means a black aura - which means some items got cursed.
Magic protection and half-spell damage can lessen this.  Wielding
Magicbane can negate it most of the time (the black aura will surround
the magic-absorbing blade).  Other things that can happen include
Rodney coming back, monsters being summoned, or nothing ("you feel
vaguely nerovous).  Having some blessed scrolls of remove curse around
is a good idea (or lots of holy water).

2.  Did you try to pray in Hell? If so, never do that.  If not, are you
*sure* the prayer timeout expired?  Did you check with enlightenment
(wand or potion)?  Perhaps you did something to anger your god without
realizing it?

3.  Did you bring 4 scrolls of gold detection and a way to confuse
yourself? Like an expired spell?  Reading an uncursed scroll of gold
detection whilst confused shows you where the portal is.  Note that the
portal on the Plane of Water moves, so you may want more than one
scroll for that plane.

The absolute fastest way to get through the Plane of Earth is a wand or
spell of digging.  If you use a pickaxe you have to fight a lot more
elementals and it takes a lot longer.

There are a couple of things I want to mention.  This is meant to be
constructive criticism.

1.  You seem underprepared.  Did you have a way to uncurse your BoH?
Here's one thing to keep in mind for next time.  Keep an extra sack.
Name it EMERGENCY.  In here put all your wands of cancellation and one
extra holy water. Now your BoH getting cursed is not such a big deal.

OR, you can put your BoH inside an oilskin sack.  That way it CANT get
cursed.  This requires more moves to get something out and requires
more foresight, but I've found it useful.

2.  -25 AC is pretty low for the end game.  Your armor can safely go to
+5, so try to get it there before you get the Book of the Dead and
attempt the end game.  Even if you enchanted it +4 and didn't bother to
try for +5, that would make your AC -38, which is much better.  I've
ascended twice with an AC of -35 after losing protection to stupid
mistakes, so take it from me.  One of those characters lost protection
because she prayed in Hell - I knew it was a bad idea, but I was
running out of options.  (It didn't help, Moloch answered the prayer).

3.  Your weapon can safely go to +7.  Try to get it close to that (at
least +6) before you go for the endgame.

4.  As for the Orb of Fate not working, a crystal has a chance of
working equal to Your Intelligence/Out of 20.  So if you have 20 INT it
will work everytime unless cursed, or out of charges.



So ... Do you have any scrolls of remove curse, holy water, or gold
detection?  How about blank scrolls and magic markers?  Lets try to
figure out what your options are.



